%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: IvanIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: What a beautiful morning, isn't it! Papers, right here, always ready.
      Ivan Tarkov, factory worker, east side. Very productive place. I love it
      there.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I do like meeting new faces at this post. I keep a list of every officer
      I've met. Just for my own records.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: That's an unusual hobby.
      npcResponse: Oh, I have many hobbies! Collecting things, counting things,
        arranging things very neatly. You have lovely cheekbones, by the way.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    - playerChoiceText: What kind of list?
      npcResponse: Names, faces, schedules. Very thorough. My mother always said
        I paid too much attention to detail. She was right!
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live alone. More room for my hobbies. Very quiet evenings. I always
      smile. Some people find that unsettling. The alleyways near the factory
      are so peaceful lately. Have you noticed?
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I go walking there in the evenings. Sometimes I bring a bag, it's
      easier that way. Papers! Everything's in order. I'm a very law-abiding citizen.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: I wouldn't walk there alone.
      npcResponse: Oh, I never feel alone! I'm very good company. Very aware of
        my surroundings at all times!
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    - playerChoiceText: What do you walk for?
      npcResponse: Fresh air! Reflection! Sometimes just to hear what the quiet
        sounds like. It sounds wonderful!
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
